100 rem  exp_after_ : result$ = part of source$ after first delim$
110 rem  call ">udd>...>exp_after_": r$, s$, d$       (r$ is output)
120 rem  handles the in-place case call ...: c$, c$, "," by using a temp.
130 sub "exp_after_": r$, s$, d$
140 let p = pos(s$, d$, 1)
150 if p = 0 then 200
160 let t$ = sst$(s$, p + len(d$), len(s$) - (p + len(d$)) + 1)
170 let r$ = t$
180 goto 210
190 rem
200 let r$ = ""
210 subend
